Data
- Every mesh, record and cross section the page shows is read at run time from the dataset
  SharpMeow/vesuvius-snapped-labels: published surface labels of the Vesuvius Challenge open data moved onto the
  papyrus surface, derived from the open data and shared under CC BY-NC 4.0, like the meshes and scans they come from.
- CT is not stored here. Visitors' browsers read it from the Vesuvius Challenge open-data bucket
  (https://scrollprize.org/data), CC BY-NC 4.0.
The Apache license of the code does not apply to the data.
